  <Placemark>
   <name>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued September 19 at 1:51PM CDT until September 19 at 2:30PM CDT by NWS Birmingham AL</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_severe</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>At 151 PM CDT, severe thunderstorms were located along a line
extending from Reece City to near Ballplay, moving south at 20 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and penny size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

Locations impacted include...
Gadsden, Rainbow City, Attalla, Hokes Bluff, Glencoe, Steele, Reece
City, Ballplay, Gadsden Mall, Noccalula Falls, Neely Henry Lake,
Southside, Gadsden Steam Plant, Big Wills Creek, Crudup, Gadsden
Municipal Airport, Rockledge, Cobb City, Northside, and Gadsden Water
Works.</Snippet>
