   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>...The Flood Warning is extended for the following rivers in
Minnesota...

Root River Near Houston affecting Houston County.

* WHAT...Minor flooding is forecast.

* WHERE...Root River near Houston.

* WHEN...From late tonight to Tuesday evening.

* IMPACTS...At 15.0 feet, Minor lowland flooding occurs.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...
- At 9:45 AM CDT Saturday the stage was 11.3 feet.
- Bankfull stage is 15.0 feet.
- Forecast...The river is expected to rise above flood stage just
after midnight tonight to a crest of 16.6 feet early tomorrow
afternoon. It will then fall below flood stage Tuesday morning.
- Flood stage is 15.0 feet.
- Flood History...This crest compares to a previous crest of 16.6
feet on 03/27/1950.
- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood</Snippet>
